{"id":1841544,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-24T21:24:55.330Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/d9LFSFgXcY37YF4WEu0mXZ4HweT.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1841544,"imdb_id":"tt47713478","origin_country":["DE"],"original_language":"de","original_title":"Das geheime Leben der Hirschkäfer","overview":"The clearing on the Polish side of the Oder is a very special habitat. Here, nature still seems to be allowed to run wild. The surrounding forest is a mixed oak forest with a rich flora and fauna. Even dead trees are allowed to remain here. The nearby Oder creates a special climate that allows rare life to thrive even in winter. The white-tailed eagle hunts in the partially frozen river, as do otters and kingfishers. In spring, a fallen oak tree in the clearing is not only a meeting place and landmark for many migratory birds. The clearing has also become a mating ground for roe deer. In autumn, the stags gather here. The fallen oak tree is also a very important habitat. Mice and squirrels have hidden their winter supplies here. Above all, however, it has become a hotspot for the largest beetle in Central Europe, the stag beetle.","popularity":0.0388,"poster_path":"/8xQlcthcnR0YjXrWashoJjrSM60.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":221119,"logo_path":null,"name":"Text und Bild Medienproduktion","origin_country":"DE"},{"id":11237,"logo_path":"/nzPEges9ftjCDQWru0qrIfTX8OR.png","name":"ZDF/Arte","origin_country":"DE"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Germany"}],"release_date":"2026-09-30","revenue":0,"runtime":44,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"German","iso_639_1":"de","name":"Deutsch"},{"english_name":"Polish","iso_639_1":"pl","name":"Polski"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Life in the Oak – A Stag Beetle Story","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":150073,"